            "notes": "To start, we are going to build a few Weapon Items such as [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). For the final item, I always pick  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) but you can choose  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) if that suits you better. \n\nIn terms of power, as we are going to be creating an enabling your team and DPS build, you are going to want to buy [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b). This power is incredibly strong and it will allow you to get yourself and your team out of some sticky situations whilst also providing insane buffs in the next few rounds.",
