            "notes": "As mentioned in the last rounds notes, we can now sell [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) as the power for this Round will take care of this.\n\nYou will want to purchase [Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) as this gives your allies bonus Attack Speed after you have healed them.\n\nFor items, you should have enough money for [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1), [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e). \n\nThe [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) gives an insane 100 Overhealth for each Suzu - it stacks too! This is a crucial item for this build and has come into clutch SO many times when DPS or the Tank is low.\n\nWhilst [Teamwork Toolkit](item_d56fb90c-cbe6-4ad5-8475-0ce920f92a3f) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) give you the Weapon Power and Attack Speed to be able to farm Damage and Healing. \n\nIf you have any extra money, you can purchase the Round 1 items for some extra bonuses to HP, Power or Attack Speed.",
